OL,4,CProtesters call on Israel to free      
OL,5,CPalestinian student held without charge
OL,6,GIsraeli students, activists and        
OL,7,Gacademics are calling for the release  
OL,8,Gof a Palestinian undergraduate who was 
OL,9,Gtaken from his university dormitory by 
OL,10,GIsraeli police earlier this month and  
OL,11,Ghas since been held without charge.    
OL,13,FMahdi Tunsi, a 26-year-old sociology   
OL,14,Fand criminology student at the Hebrew  
OL,15,FUniversity of Jerusalem, appeared in   
OL,16,Fan Israeli court in the city on        
OL,17,FTuesday - a hearing that was held      
OL,18,Fbehind closed doors.                   
OL,20,FIsraeli police say he was arrested     
OL,21,F"concerning ties to an act of          
OL,22,Fterrorism".                            
